  "title": "Apricot and Peach Fried Pies",
  "description": "Dried apricots and peaches are cooked down to make a luscious filling for crispy, flaky hand-held pies.",
  "authors": [
    "Elaine"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-01-18T22:36:11-05:00",
